     "field": "note",
     "from": null,
     "to": "Maker page unitree.com/g1 re-checked 2026-11-17: standing 1,320 x 450 x 200 mm (H x W x T), folded 690 x 450 x 300 mm, 35 kg with battery, 23 DoF base (23-43 EDU), arm load about 2 kg (3 kg EDU), about 2 h, US$13.5K base (tax and shipping excluded). The stored height is the maker's standing figure; an earlier G1 manual and the May-2024 launch coverage give 1,270 mm (127 cm), which the current maker page does not state. | Maker figures: 1320 x 450 x 200 mm standing (690 x 450 x 300 folded), ~35 kg, 23 DoF (G1) or 23-43 (G1 EDU), 6 per leg, 1 waist (+2 optional), 5 per arm, optional 7-DoF three-finger hand, 90 Nm knee (120 Nm on EDU), about 2 kg arm load (3 kg on EDU), 9000 mAh quick-release pack, about 2 h, depth camera plus 3D LiDAR, 4-microphone array, 5 W speaker, Wi-Fi 6 and Bluetooth 5.2, 8-core CPU; trotting speed above 2 m/s. Price US$13,500 for G1."
